---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact SportsRulesDesk"
  description="Get in touch with the SportsRulesDesk team for corrections, questions, or partnership inquiries."
  current="contact"
>
  <div class="wrap page-body">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>
      Spotted a rule that changed, found an error, or have a question about how something
      is explained on this site? Reach out and we'll take a look.
    </p>
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:contact@sports.fdaytalk.com">contact@sports.fdaytalk.com</a>
    </p>
    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>
      Rules change across seasons. If you believe an article is out of date, please include
      the article title and a link to the relevant official rule update so we can verify
      and correct it quickly.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
